"t": "Maximum and minimum combat values. Attack max/min, health max/min, number of technologies. Zerg: Zergling: attack 6/4, health 6/4, 2 tech; Hydralisk: attack 7/5, health 6/5, 1 tech; Ultralisk: attack 8/7, health 9/8, 1 tech; Queen: Assist, 4 tech; Defiler: Assist, 3 tech; Scourge: attack 8/7, health 6/5, 0 tech, Sacrifice; Mutalisk: attack 8/7, health 8/6, 0 tech; Guardian: attack 8/7, health 8/7, 1 tech; Devourer: attack 8/7, health 9/8, 1 tech; Lurker: attack 8/6, health 7/6, 0 tech, Cloaking; Infested Terran: attack 8/7, health 6/5, 0 tech, Sacrifice. Terran: Marine: attack 6/5, health 6/4, 2 tech; Firebat: attack 6/5, health 6/4, 2 tech; Ghost: attack 6/5, health 6/4, 3 tech; Vulture: attack 7/5, health 7/6, 1 tech; Goliath: attack 7/6, health 8/7, 1 tech; Siege Tank: attack 8/7, health 8/7, 1 tech; Wraith: attack 8/6, health 7/7, 1 tech; Science Vessel: Assist, 3 tech, Detector; Battlecruiser: attack 8/7, health 9/8, 1 tech; Medic: Assist, 3 tech; Valkyrie: attack 9/6, health 7/6, 0 tech. Protoss: Zealot: attack 7/5, health 7/5, 1 tech; Dragoon: attack 8/6, health 7/6, 1 tech; High Templar: Assist, 3 tech; Reaver: attack 9/7, health 8/7, 1 tech; Archon: attack 9/8, health 9/8, 0 tech; Scout: attack 8/7, health 8/7, 0 tech; Arbiter: Assist, 3 tech; Carrier: attack 9/7, health 9/8, 1 tech; Dark Archon: Assist, 3 tech; Dark Templar: attack 8/7, health 7/6, 0 tech, Cloaking; Corsair: attack 8/7, health 7/6, 1 tech."
